{"answer": "我来检索语料中与张锡纯、陆渊雷相关的文献与著述，先定位其著作与可检索段落。\n\n《医学衷中参西录》有 4895 段；陆渊雷的著作需另找。继续定位。\n\n陆渊雷的《伤寒今释》未见于书目，我先确认语料覆盖情况，并同步启动一次系统研究。\n\n陆渊雷的著作未收入语料，他主要以被引形式出现。研究任务仍在后台运行，我继续从原文取证。]<]minimax[>[<相应参数>\n]<]minimax[>[<invoke name=\"古籍检索\">]<]minimax[>[<k>20]<]minimax[>[</k>]<]minimax[>[<query>渊雷]<]minimax[>[</query>]<]minimax[>[</invoke>\n]<]minimax[>[<invoke name=\"古籍检索\">]<]minimax[>[<k>8]<]minimax[>[</k>]<]minimax[>[<query>石膏 性凉而能散 透表解肌 清阳明胃腑实热]<]minimax[>[</query>]<]minimax[>[</invoke>\n]<]minimax[>[<invoke name=\"调用工具\">]<]minimax[>[<tool>争议挖掘]<]minimax[>[</tool>]<]minimax[>[<arguments>]<]minimax[>[</arguments>]<]minimax[>[</invoke>\n]<]minimax[>[<invoke name=\"原文细读\">]<]minimax[>[<段落编号>相应参数.03382]<]minimax[>[</段落编号>]<]minimax[>[</invoke>\n]<]minimax[>[</tool_call>", "app": "0.1.0", "asleep": 0, "citations": {"bad": 0, "ok": 0, "pending": 0, "pids": [], "total": 0, "warn": 0}, "conversation": "c_mwe7q4k41jhfl3", "corpus": "full", "error": "你选择了不再等待工具，回答可能不完整。", "events": [{"at": 144895, "what": "asked"}], "finished": "2026-11-13T00:04:59.789Z", "hidden": 0, "id": "m_mwe7q4ku0fbyrc", "model": "MiniMax-M3", "ms": 152129, "n": 1195, "provider": "impf", "question": "张锡纯与陆渊雷的学术比较", "received": "2026-11-13T00:05:00.144Z", "redacted": 9, "requests": [{"asks": 1, "asleep": 0, "attempt": 1, "end": 6869, "finish": "tool_calls", "first": 5311, "hidden": 0, "input": 7464, "last": 6869, "open": 5309, "output": 414, "round": 1, "sent": 566, "text": 6176, "via": "direct"}, {"asks": 1, "asleep": 0, "attempt": 1, "end": 29070, "finish": "tool_calls", "first": 27413, "hidden": 0, "input": 11175, "last": 29069, "open": 27413, "output": 374, "round": 2, "sent": 25482, "text": 28258, "via": "direct"}, {"asks": 1, "asleep": 0, "attempt": 1, "end": 49129, "finish": "tool_calls", "first": 42494, "hidden": 0, "input": 18015, "last": 49128, "open": 42494, "output": 1323, "round": 3, "sent": 39933, "text": 47507, "via": "direct"}, {"asks": 1, "asleep": 0, "attempt": 1, "end": 152128, "finish": 